\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Observed and calculated Raman wavenumbers of isolated N-acetylmuramic acid with proposed vibrational assignments. Calculated values are scaled (0.980 below 1800\nobreakspace  {}\ensuremath  {\mathrm  {cm}^{-1}}{}). $\Delta = \nu _{\mathrm  {exp}} - \nu _{\mathrm  {calc}}$. Reproducibility is the percentage of the 22 independent spectra in which the band was detected. $\nu $: stretching; $\delta $: in-plane bending; $\gamma $: out-of-plane bending. $^{\dagger }$Tentative: satisfies only one of the two signal-to-noise criteria of Section\nobreakspace  {}2.6.}}{13}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
